54:// Mirrors Direct3d9_TextureData.cpp:33-54 layout. Unsupported / unmappable
55:// formats use DXGI_FORMAT_UNKNOWN; the install-time CheckFeatureSupport
56:// pass below marks those entries unsupported and the engine falls through
57:// to the next runtimeFormat candidate.
