erData.cpp:8), [Direct3d11_StaticVertexBufferData.cpp](/abs/path/D:/Code/swg-client-v2/src/engine/cli
ent/application/Direct3d11/src/win32/Direct3d11_StaticVertexBufferData.cpp:167)). Dynamic VBs/IBs 
are shared rings using `WRITE_DISCARD` on wrap/new frame and `WRITE_NO_OVERWRITE` otherwise ([Direct3
d11_DynamicVertexBufferData.cpp](/abs/path/D:/Code/swg-client-v2/src/engine/client/application/Direct
3d11/src/win32/Direct3d11_DynamicVertexBufferData.cpp:259), [Direct3d11_DynamicIndexBufferData.cpp](/
abs/path/D:/Code/swg-client-v2/src/engine/client/application/Direct3d11/src/win32/Direct3d11_DynamicI
ndexBufferData.cpp:118)). Input layouts are cached in `Direct3d11_VertexDeclarationMap` by VB format 
