cpp](/abs/path/D:/Code/swg-client-v2/src/engine/client/application/Direct3d11/src/win32/Direct3d11_Ve
rtexDeclarationMap.cpp:190), [Direct3d11_VertexDeclarationMap.cpp](/abs/path/D:/Code/swg-client-v2/sr
c/engine/client/application/Direct3d11/src/win32/Direct3d11_VertexDeclarationMap.cpp:320)). It binds 
