Divergences: Both converge on static CPU shadows and dynamic rings. A’s draw/input-layout logic is 
inside `StateCache` and includes phantom-slot fallback; B splits drawing into `Direct3d11_Draw` and 
has a more explicit system-memory mirror/ring discipline.

**6. Textures**
Repo A: texture format mapping is an inline `translationTable`, with unsupported formats as 
