`UpdateSubresource` (B `Direct3d11_TextureData.cpp:891-982`). Static shader binding maps sampler 
stage to reflected texture slot and validates SRV dimension mismatch (B 
`Direct3d11_StaticShaderData.cpp:644-692`).

Divergences: A has direct mapping/conversion in `TextureData` plus cached RTVs; B has a more formal 
native/storage/DXGI format model, initialized-subresource tracking, explicit converter subsystem, 
volume/cube documentation, and SRV dimension validation. B is more complete on texture evidence.

| subsystem | A approach | B approach | divergent? | more complete on evidence |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Device/context | Monolithic `Device` owns device/swap/context/RTV/DSV; fatal removed/reset; resize 
in same file | Split `Device` + `SwapChain`; D3D11.1 context; tearing/occlusion; fires lost/restored 
on resize | Yes | B |
| State management | Embedded `StateCache` caches by compact integer keys; broad pass compatibility 
in cache | Separate descriptor-keyed `StateObjectCache` plus pointer-shadow bind cache | Yes | B 
structurally; A has more compatibility patches |
| Shader system | D3DCompile + source rewrite + persistent `.cso`; runtime assembly VS fallback and 
generated fallback PS | Modular source/compiler/reflection/signature/cache; refuses assembly; 
depends on converted HLSL | Yes | A for runtime legacy fallback; B for modularity |
| Constant buffers | Generic VS/PS slot wrapper; all-slot D3D11.1 `NO_OVERWRITE` ring; transposes 
matrices | D3D9 register-file shadows; separate globals/epilogue/per-object ring; no transposes | 
Yes | B for ABI clarity; A for broader ring coverage |
| VB/IB/input layout | Static shadows + UpdateSubresource; dynamic rings; input layouts in 
`VertexDeclarationMap`; phantom zero slot | Static shadows + UpdateSubresource; dynamic ring with 
scratch mirror; draw/input layouts split into `Draw`/`InputLayoutCache` | Yes, mostly 
organization/details | Insufficient evidence; both comparable |
| Textures | Inline format table; dynamic map/staging; cached RTVs; reflected stage→SRV remap | 
Native/storage/DXGI model; converter subsystem; initialized-subresource tracking; cube/volume 
handling; dimension validation | Yes | B |
